  title="Eaton — Kyle Xu"
  description="UX Design Intern at Eaton, June–August 2022. RapidLinkX, an IoT configuration tool for airport conveyor systems: a parameter editor and a fault monitor for airport engineers. In a comparative usability test the drag-and-drop editor was 35% faster and made 15% more errors, so the form shipped. 14 component variants added to Eaton's design system; in usability testing, operational efficiency +49.7% and error rates −36.8%. The decisions first, then the whole process: stakeholders, workshops, personas, 60 hi-fi pages over 10 workflows, the test, the hand-off, a mobile exploration."
